# Remote node, first use: the device starts with no node chosen and opens
# Remote node; find the node, a wrong PIN is refused, the right one
# connects and the node's contacts appear.
# remote-only
nopair
blepin 654321
node Bob 7.5
as Bob advert
wait 3000
shot remote-first-boot
expect linked 0
# Find nodes nearby, choose the node, type a wrong PIN over the default
key enter
wait 500
shot remote-scan
key enter
shot remote-pin
key bksp 6
type 111111
key enter
wait 1000
shot remote-wrong-pin
expect linked 0
key enter
wait 500
key enter
key bksp 6
type 654321
key enter
wait 4000
shot remote-connected
expect linked 1
expect contacts 1
hold esc 900
shot remote-home
